"``no_reorient`` 、 ``no_com`` ）"
msgstr ""
"Neutral, straight hydrogen chain with equally spaced atoms and open ends."
" The atoms are spaced 1.8 Å apart along the :math:`x` axis (``symmetry "
"c1``, ``no_reorient``, ``no_com``)."

